"┌thndrs──────────────┐┌Transcript──────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│Sessions   ┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐           │"
"│ ● scratch │  Key          Action                                 │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  Enter        submit prompt / execute command        │d8888b     │"
"│           │  Esc          cancel stream / close overlay          │8K         │"
"│           │  Up/Down k/j  scroll transcript (empty input)        │Y8888b.    │"
"│           │  PgUp/PgDn    scroll by 10 lines                     │    X88    │"
"│           │  Ctrl+C       quit immediately                       │88888P'    │"
"│           │  Ctrl+D x2    quit (double-press within 3s)          │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  Command      Description                            │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  :            enter command mode                     │           │"
"│           │  ?            toggle this help overlay               │           │"
"│           │  /clear       clear the transcript                   │           │"
"│           │  /quit  /exit quit the app                           │           │"
"│           │  :help        show this help overlay                 │           │"
"│  ·  idle  │  :bg          list background processes              │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"└───────────│  Press ? or Esc to close.                            │───────────┘"
